  "type": "sector",
  "priority": "medium",
  "published": "2026-09-28",
  "insights": [
   "Net purchase intent (NPI) across the coverage universe softened modestly in August, while net promoter scores (NPS) moderated.",
   "Consumer sentiment regarding coupons/promotions and variety improved sequentially, but key purchase drivers like selection, styles, and availability saw moderation.",
   "Y/Y momentum improved for Under Armour, FIGS, Warby Parker, Shark, Levi\u2019s, Burlington, and Ross.",
   "Brands showing moderation in Y/Y momentum include UGG, Urban Outfitters, Ninja, Crocs, and HomeGoods.",
   "Google search interest growth was strongest at Salomon, FIGS, and Helly Hansen, while Urban Outfitters, lululemon, and Timberland saw the weakest Y/Y growth.",
   "Sequential search momentum improved most at Salomon, Arc\u2019teryx, and Wilson, while trends weakened for Urban Outfitters, Gap, and Timberland.",
   "The report notes ongoing noise and inconsistency in Google Trends data, suggesting directional changes are more informative than absolute levels."
  ],
